:"text","text":"and whether these are in an accessible format or available in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"alternative form, e.g., whether math and chemical formulas are navigable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with assistive technologies, or whether extended descriptions are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"available for information-rich images. In addition, it indicates the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presence of videos and if closed captions, open captions, or transcripts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for prerecorded audio are available."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/readiumshared\/accessibilitymetadatadisplayguide\/richcontent-swift.struct","title":"AccessibilityMetadataDisplayGuide.RichContent","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RichContent","kind":"identifier"}]}}}